 station and other cellular infrastructure system-on-chips (SoCs); Ceva XC20 DSPs and the PentaG2 platform support 5G/5G Advanced baseband for mobile broadband, RedCap, and IoT devices; Ceva-BX2 baseband processor; Ceva-XC21, high-efficiency vector DSP cores for 5G and 5G-advanced; Ceva-XC23, DSP for 5G and 5G-advanced; and Ceva-Waves Bluetooth platform, a set of hardware IP, software modules, and radios addressing a range of processes and nodes. It also provides Ceva-Waves Wi-Fi platform, a set of hardware IP and CPU-agnostic host software for energy-efficient SoC implementation of Wi-Fi subsystems; Ceva-Waves ultra-wideband platform; Ceva-Waves Links, which provide solutions for SoCs requiring multiple connectivity standards; and Ceva-Waves DragonFly, a turnkey platform for implementing NB-IoT cellular modem SoCs. In addition, the company offers Ceva-SensPro, a family of DSP cores; Ceva-BX1 audio digital signal controller IP; Ceva-ClearVox ENC software, a neural-network-based noise cancellation; Ceva-RealSpace, a spatial audio and head tracking software solution; and Ceva-MotionEngine, a sensor fusion software. Further, it provides Ceva-NeuPro-M, a neural processing unit (NPU) IP for generative AI; a Ceva-NeuPro-Nano, an NPU IP for embedded AI; and Ceva-NeuPro Studio, a software development environment for the development and deployment of AI models on the Ceva-NeuPro NPUs. The company was formerly known as ParthusCeva, Inc. and changed its name to CEVA, Inc. in December 2003. The company was incorporated in 1999 and is headquartered in Rockville, Maryland.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Amir  Panush | CEO & Director | Age 51 | Compensation: $1.0M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 374 people. Revenue per employee of $293K ranks in the below the sector median among Technology peers. Stock-based compensation of $53K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 3\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags elevated compensation governance risk (9/10).","financial_summary":["CEVA, Inc. is a small-cap technology business with a $763M market cap on $110M of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at -7% over the past three years and +6% annually across the full decade, and a shrinking top line is the hardest headwind any business can overcome.","Returns on capital run at -7% against a 12% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests. Gross margins of 89% confirm genuine pricing power.","The company is burning through $6M of cash, and without positive owner earnings any valuation rests on hope rather than evidence.","On the balance sheet, interest coverage of 40\u00d7 is fortress-like.","Shareholder yield is only 0.9%, a thin return of capital, and stock-based comp at 18% of revenue is silent dilution an owner has to account for, and insiders hold 3.5% of the shares, and profit capture is only 0.0\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Piotroski score 3/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Operating margins 17% below sector median \u2014 a cost disadvantage the moat cannot hide","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Volatile returns on capital suggest the moat is narrower than a snapshot ROIC implies","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Elevated short interest (10.8% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting the other way","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Revenue growth lags most Technology peers \u2014 losing share inside the profit pool","sev":"amber","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Financial quality metrics lag Technology peers","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Technology sector lagging the market significantly, underperforming by 7% over 3 months","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Elevated sector volatility (35% annualized) adds uncertainty","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Cybersecurity liability and talent cost inflation \u2014 a single breach can erase years of goodwill, and the war for engineering talent compresses margins even at scale.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Valued at a 658% discount to sector median EV/EBITDA","Altman Z comfortably in the safe zone \u2014 a fortress balance sheet on this measure","Gross margin tops the Technology peer set \u2014 genuine pricing power is present here"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"NSING Technologies Ships Over 250 Million Bluetooth Chips Featuring Ceva-Waves IP","source":"kalkinemedia.com","link":"https://kalkinemedia.com/us/news/announcements/nsing-technologies-ships-over-250-million-bluetooth-chips-featuring-ceva-waves-ip","date":"2026-11-05","timestamp":1793859869.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"NSING Technologies Surpasses 250 Million Bluetooth Chips Shipped Powered by Ceva Technology","source":"prnewswire.com","link":"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/nsing-technologies-surpasses-250-million-bluetooth-chips-shipped-powered-by-ceva-technology-302926408.html","date":"2026-11-05","timestamp":1793855842.128004,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.402,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Ceva Welcomes Introduction of Bluetooth High Data Throughput, Accelerating Next-Generation Wireless Connectivity","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/technology/articles/ceva-welcomes-introduction-bluetooth-high-143200437.html","date":"2026-11-04","timestamp":1793802720.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.937,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Ceva (NASDAQ:CEVA) Stock Rating Upgraded by Wall Street Zen","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/02/ceva-nasdaqceva-stock-rating-upgraded-